<!--
  Not a live recording. Modelled on Elsevier's publicly documented Article
  Retrieval `view=FULL` response shape (`full-text-retrieval-response`,
  `coredata`, `originalText`, the `ce:` "common" element vocabulary for
  `ce:abstract` / `ce:sections` / `ce:section` / `ce:para`), the same status
  as `tests/fixtures/cassettes/abstract-full-multi-subject-area.json` (see
  `tests/fixtures/README.md`). Every title, author name and paragraph below
  is synthetic prose written for this fixture, not copied from a real
  Elsevier article: there is nothing here for `sanitise.py` to redact.
-->
